OL,3,ATrump downplays warnings of AI risks,
OL,4,Aciting rivalry with China
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has
OL,7,Fdownplayed risks posed by artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence following days of dire
OL,9,Fwarnings by experts.
OL,11,F"You have a lot of very negative forces
OL,12,Fthat are bringing it up that shouldn't
OL,13,Fbe bringing it up and they're bringing
OL,14,Fup things that won't happen," Trump
OL,15,Fsaid during a visit to Ireland.
OL,17,FOne of the warnings came from a former
OL,18,FAnthropic researcher who said "there is
OL,19,Fa strong chance that we could all die
OL,20,Fin the immediate future" if the current
OL,21,Fpace of development continued.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/17
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
