OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ATrump downplays warnings of AI risks,
OL,4,Aciting rivalry with China
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday, top industry bosses agreed
OL,7,Fand called for a slow-down. Trump did
OL,8,Fnot directly address the idea, but
OL,9,Fsaid: "We're leading China on AI...
OL,10,Fand, frankly, I want to keep it that
OL,11,Fway because whoever wins AI, wins."
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/17
