OL,3,ADiljit Dosanjh makes history under the
OL,4,Afamous Wembley arch
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday night, under the
OL,7,Fworld-famous Wembley arch, five words
OL,8,Frang out: "Punjabi Aa Gaye Wembley
OL,9,FOye!"
OL,11,FIndian megastar Diljit Dosanjh famously
OL,12,Fstarts all his concerts by announcing
OL,13,Fthat "the Punjabis have arrived".
OL,15,FBut this time, it was a play on the
OL,16,Fusual catchphrase.
OL,18,FDosanjh is the first ever Punjabi
OL,19,Fsinger to headline Wembley Stadium, the
OL,20,Fmusic venue has said.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/17
